"# Presence API\n\n- **Base URL:** `https://presence.sls.epilot.io`\n- **Full API Docs:** [https://docs.epilot.io/api/presence](https://docs.epilot.io/api/presence)\n\n## Usage\n\n```ts\nimport { epilot } from '@epilot/sdk'\n\nepilot.authorize(() => '<token>')\nconst { data } = await epilot.presence.heartbeatPresence(...)\n```\n\n### Tree-shakeable import\n\n```ts\nimport { getClient, authorize } from '@epilot/sdk/presence'\n\nconst presenceClient = getClient()\nauthorize(presenceClient, () => '<token>')\nconst { data } = await presenceClient.heartbeatPresence(...)\n```\n\n## Operations\n\n**Presence**\n- [`heartbeatPresence`](#heartbeatpresence)\n- [`leavePresence`](#leavepresence)\n\n**Schemas**\n- [`PresenceResourceType`](#presenceresourcetype)\n- [`PresenceState`](#presencestate)\n- [`SessionId`](#sessionid)\n- [`InstanceId`](#instanceid)\n- [`PresenceHeartbeat`](#presenceheartbeat)\n- [`PresenceLeave`](#presenceleave)\n- [`PresenceMember`](#presencemember)\n- [`PresenceRoster`](#presenceroster)\n- [`ErrorResponse`](#errorresponse)\n\n### `heartbeatPresence`\n\nAnnounces the caller on a resource, or refreshes their presence there, and returns everyone\ncurrently present.\n\n`POST /v1/presence/{resource_type}/{resource_id}/heartbeat`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.heartbeatPresence(\n  {\n    resource_type: 'example',\n    resource_id: 'example',\n    x-epilot-org-id: 'example',\n  },\n  {\n    session_id: 'f7c1b2a0-3e4d-4c8e-9a1b-2d3e4f5a6b7c',\n    instance_id: 'b1f0c2d3e4',\n    state: 'editing'\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"members\": [\n    {\n      \"user_id\": \"123456\",\n      \"user_org\": \"123\",\n      \"state\": \"editing\",\n      \"last_seen_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"is_self\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"ttl_seconds\": 60,\n  \"heartbeat_interval_seconds\": 20,\n  \"truncated\": true\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `leavePresence`\n\nRemoves the caller's session from the resource at once, for example when the tab closes or the\nuser navigates away.\n\n`POST /v1/presence/{resource_type}/{resource_id}/leave`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.leavePresence(\n  {\n    resource_type: 'example',\n    resource_id: 'example',\n    x-epilot-org-id: 'example',\n  },\n  {\n    session_id: 'f7c1b2a0-3e4d-4c8e-9a1b-2d3e4f5a6b7c',\n    instance_id: 'b1f0c2d3e4'\n  },\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Schemas\n\n### `PresenceResourceType`\n\nKind of resource, and the permission needed to see who is present on it:\n- `journey`: `entity:view` on the journey. The resource ID is the journey's entity ID.\n- `customer_portal`: `customer_portal:view` on the portal\n- `installer_portal`: `installer_portal:view` on the portal\n- `flow`: `workflow:de\n\n```ts\ntype PresenceResourceType = \"journey\" | \"customer_portal\" | \"installer_portal\" | \"flow\"\n```\n\n### `PresenceState`\n\n`viewing`: the resource is open. `editing`: it is open with unsaved changes.\n\n```ts\ntype PresenceState = \"viewing\" | \"editing\"\n```\n\n### `SessionId`\n\nGenerated by the client, one per browser tab. A user can be present with several tabs.\n\n```ts\ntype SessionId = string\n```\n\n### `InstanceId`\n\nOptional. Generated by the client each time it starts sending heartbeats in a tab. A leave that\ncarries it only takes effect while that instance sent the session's latest heartbeat, so a late\nleave from an earlier instance in the same tab cannot remove the session.\n\n\n```ts\ntype InstanceId = string\n```\n\n### `PresenceHeartbeat`\n\n```ts\ntype PresenceHeartbeat = {\n  session_id: string\n  instance_id?: string\n  state?: \"viewing\" | \"editing\"\n}\n```\n\n### `PresenceLeave`\n\n```ts\ntype PresenceLeave = {\n  session_id: string\n  instance_id?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `PresenceMember`\n\nA user present on the resource. Several tabs of the same user count as one member.\n\n```ts\ntype PresenceMember = {\n  user_id: string\n  user_org?: string\n  state: \"viewing\" | \"editing\"\n  last_seen_at: string // date-time\n  is_self: boolean\n}\n```\n\n### `PresenceRoster`\n\n```ts\ntype PresenceRoster = {\n  members: Array<{\n    user_id: string\n    user_org?: string\n    state: \"viewing\" | \"editing\"\n    last_seen_at: string // date-time\n    is_self: boolean\n  }>\n  ttl_seconds: number\n  heartbeat_interval_seconds: number\n  truncated?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n### `ErrorResponse`\n\n```ts\ntype ErrorResponse = {\n  status?: number\n  error?: string | object[]\n}\n```\n"
